Rust crate dependencies
-----------------------

The native binary statically links Rust crates published on crates.io under
their own licenses (mostly MIT and/or Apache-2.0; also ISC, BSD, BSL-1.0, Zlib,
Unicode-3.0, CDLA-Permissive-2.0 and MPL-2.0). Every GitHub release attaches
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md, which lists each crate, version, license and repository
and reproduces the license and notice files shipped with each crate. Generate it
locally with:

    node scripts/generate-third-party-notices.mjs

npm package dependencies
------------------------

The npm package @zero-x.live/neuron installs, but does not bundle,
codebase-memory-mcp (MIT License) and @playwright/mcp (Apache License 2.0).
npm installs them with their own license files.

